  "summary": "Replaced the C-clip latch retention with a coordinated clipless bayonet wall rig and latch.",
  "changes": [
    "Added a pronounced keyed bayonet lug to the wall-rig pivot and a matching printable diagonal latch keyway; install the latch over the lug, then rotate it to retain it without a C-clip.",
    "Added the latch's second retaining wall so the weight remains laterally captive in either cassette orientation.",
    "Shortened the roller's keyed-shoe span by 1.2 mm total for clearance at the cassette side walls.",
    "Renamed Dry Wall Rig to Wall Rig and Latch and Keeper to Latch, and removed the obsolete keeper from the prepared Everything Else project.",
    "Retained the wall rig's support enforcer and the capstans' prepared support settings; carried the frame, stand, capstans, clock-string guide, and main-frame geometry forward unchanged."
  ],
